  "objects": [
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-1",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 28,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "操作说明 · 全工具指南",
      "fontSize": 32
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-2",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 90,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "1.1.0：更多选单改用统一的绿色描边图示。屏幕画布自订工具列可「应用」即时预览，或保存後关闭；取消只放弃尚未应用的修改。它只调整屏幕支援的工具，保留一般画布的图钉、视角锁定及其他自订设定。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-3",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 212,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 260,
      "zIndex": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "01 介面与手册语言 · 02 开始使用 · 03 首页与作品库 · 04 画布格式与页面 · 05 平移、缩放与视角锁定 · 06 导览与工具列 · 07 右键工具轮盘 · 08 画笔与笔刷 · 09 线段、箭头、形状与曲线 · 10 选择与物件变形 · 11 属性、色彩与样式 · 12 文字与便条纸 · 13 橡皮擦 · 14 尺规 · 15 圆规：准备、锁定、画弧 · 16 教学提醒：雷射与藤条 · 17 计算机与计时器 · 18 图片、截图与裁切 · 19 图钉与配色 · 20 屏幕画布 · 21 保存、数据与导出 · 22 快捷键速查 · 23 程序更新 · 24 功能范围与已知限制 · 25 背景设定操作要点 · 26 图层顺序与操作回馈",
      "fontSize": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-4",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 3,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "01 · 介面与手册语言",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-5",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 602,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 4,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "首页侧栏下方「语言」（收合时为文/A图示）提供繁体中文（默认）、简体中文、英文、日文、韩文、西班牙文、法文、德文、葡萄牙文（巴西）、阿拉伯文。保存成功立即应用，下次启动沿用。既有作品名称与文字不翻译，新建的默认名称采当时语言。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-6",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 724,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 5,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "使用说明随目前介面语言开启；本页语言选单只切换手册，不改程序偏好。全部手册、章节与搜寻均可离线使用。阿拉伯文介面与手册从右向左阅读，画布座标不镜像。系统选档与原始错误讯息可能使用其他语言，部分内建控制项可能需重新启动。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-7",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 902,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 6,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "02 · 开始使用",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-8",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 964,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 7,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "首页按＋新增，选笔记本、无边界画布或有边界黑板，输入名称并设定背景色与样式。画笔用来手写，选择工具（V）用来移动及调整物件。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-9",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1056,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 8,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "自动存档默认关闭。Ctrl+S可手动保存，离开作品或正常退出也会保存。导出.heiban可作为可编辑备份。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-10",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1204,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 9,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "03 · 首页与作品库",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-11",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1266,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 10,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "单击卡片只反白，不显示批次操作列；双击或右键「开启作品」进入。右键亦可收藏、改名、副本与移到垃圾桶。垃圾桶保留原稿，双击垃圾桶卡片可还原。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-12",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1358,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 230,
      "zIndex": 11,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "按导入旁虚线圆进入多选，圆圈打勾表示已选；可全选目前结果或逐张选择，再移到垃圾桶，「完成」离开多选。可搜寻名称、筛选格式、依修改／建立／名称排序及选160／190／250 pt缩图。导入支援.heiban／.blackboard.json；侧栏切换全部、收藏与垃圾桶。 工具列默认为「图示与文字」，常用分页预先包含笔刷与线条样式；可在自订工具列调整。首次使用会加入「操作说明 · 全工具指南」无边界笔记，涵盖全部工具及可编辑范例。用中键拖曳／空白键加拖曳平移，滚轮缩放，开图钉清单可跳到各章。旧范例与已编辑作品不会被覆写；修改或删除新指南後不会每次重建。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-13",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1656,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 12,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "04 · 画布格式与页面",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-14",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1718,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 13,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "笔记本各页独立，底部页码与左右箭头翻页，＋新增页；页码选单可跳页、改名、副本、排序及删页。无边界画布可向任意方向延伸。有边界黑板提供固定纸张边界，适合简报与排版。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-15",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1810,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 14,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "无边界不显示尺寸。新有边界黑板首次默认16:9简报（1920×1080），仍可改A4直向、A4横向或1:1；切换格式记住此对话框已选尺寸。新增与画布背景提供空白、横线、点状、方格、五线谱及底色；既有作品按应用才修改，取消保留，修改可单步撤销。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-16",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1988,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 15,
